e problem. The most attractive solution will need to be reevaluated and implemented.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Remove unused imports from lib/projects.ts","EndLine":1,"Instruction":"Remove unused types ProjectCategory, ProjectMetric, CaseStudy","ReplacementContent":"import { Project } from \"@/types\";","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"import { Project, ProjectCategory, ProjectMetric, CaseStudy } from \"@/types\";","TargetFile":"/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/lib/projects.ts","toolAction":"Fix projects.ts unused imports","toolSummary":"File edit"}},{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/home/WorkflowSteps.tsx","toolAction":"View WorkflowSteps.tsx","toolSummary":"View file"}}]}
