{"step_index":577,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-24T02:04:30Z","content":"Created At: 2026-07-23T21:04:30-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-07-23T21:04:30-05:00\nFile Path: `file:///home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/.agents/rules/core.md`\nTotal Lines: 82\nTotal Bytes: 2170\nShowing lines 1 to 82\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: ---\n2: trigger: always_on\n3: description: Core project instructions for buildroot_ website\n4: ---\n5: \n6: # Core Rules — buildroot_\n7: \n8: ## Project Identity\n9: \n10: - **Company**: buildroot_ (tech venture, 2-3 people)\n11: - **Services**: Web development, technical consulting, SaaS products\n12: - **Style**: Brutalist hybrid (raw + elegant)\n13: - **Mode**: Light mode, dark hero (blue)\n14: \n15: ## Tech Stack (Non-negotiable)\n16: \n17: | Layer | Technology |\n18: |-------|------------|\n19: | Framework | Next.js 14 (App Router) |\n20: | Language | TypeScript (strict) |\n21: | Styling | Tailwind CSS 4 |\n22: | Animations | Framer Motion |\n23: | Scroll | Lenis |\n24: | Icons | Lucide React |\n25: | Forms | Formspree |\n26: | Deploy | Vercel (free tier) |\n27: \n28: ## Design Tokens\n29: \n30: - **Font Display**: Space Grotesk\n31: - **Font Mono**: JetBrains Mono\n32: - **Hero**: `#0F172A` (azul marino)\n33: - **Body**: `#F8FAFC` (off-white frío)\n34: - **Secondary**: `#E2E8F0` (gris azulado)\n35: - **Accent**: `#2563EB` (azul vibrante)\n36: - **Border**: `#0F172A` (azul oscuro)\n37: - **Text Primary**: `#0F172A`\n38: - **Text Muted**: `#64748B`\n39: - **Text Inverse**: `#F8FAFC`\n40: \n41: ## Performance Targets\n42: \n43: | Metric | Target |\n44: |--------|--------|\n45: | Lighthouse Performance | 95+ |\n46: | Lighthouse Accessibility | 95+ |\n47: | Lighthouse SEO | 100 |\n48: | FCP | <1.5s |\n49: | LCP | <2.5s |\n50: | TBT | <200ms |\n51: | CLS | <0.1 |\n52: \n53: ## File Structure\n54: \n55: ```\n56: buildroot/\n57: ├── app/              # Next.js App Router pages\n58: ├── components/       # React components (ui/, layout/, home/, work/, about/, process/)\n59: ├── lib/              # Utilities, data, constants\n60: ├── public/           # Static assets\n61: └── .agents/          # AI configuration\n62: ```\n63: \n64: ## Git Workflow\n65: \n66: See: `.agents/rules/git-workflow.md`\n67: \n68: - **Main branches**: `main` (production), `develop` (integration)\n69: - **Feature branches**: `feature/<name>`, `fix/<name>`, `chore/<name>`\n70: - **Commits**: Conventional commits format\n71: - **PRs**: Required for all changes to `main` and `develop`\n72: \n73: ## Constraints\n74: \n75: - NO runtime chat agents on the site\n76: - NO heavy JS libraries (keep bundle small)\n77: - ALL content in English\n78: - EVERY page must be accessible (WCAG 2.1 AA)\n79: - EVERY component must be responsive\n80: - ALWAYS use conventional commits\n81: - ALWAYS create feature branches for new work\n82: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
