{"step_index":1202,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-24T04:05:42Z","content":"{{ CHECKPOINT 11 }}\n **The earlier parts of this conversation have been truncated due to its long length. The following content summarizes the truncated context so that you may continue your work. **\n\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. perfecta, hazla mas ancha.\n2. las lineas un poco mas gruesas.\n3. la linea de la flecha de hello... igual de gruesa\n4. la linea ipiales, colombia no la alargues.\n5. ahora todos los elementos a jsutificados a la derecha\n6. hay alguna forma en que lo podamos poner en tres lineas?\n7. no, no... todo tiene que quedar igual en una caja mas corta que la mitad\n8. no, no... todo tiene que quedar igual en una caja hasta un poco mas larga de la mitad..\n9. quiero 3 lineas perfectamente equilibradas, que su \"caja\" no cubra sino un poco mas de la mitad de la pantaja en x\n10. no, se pasa y no se lee la infomacion\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n### 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Visual Fine-tuning:** Verify if the final balance of the 3-line Footer layout (with reduced font size) meets the user's aesthetic standards for \"perfectly balanced.\" Status: **IMPLEMENTATION**.\n\n### 2. User Knowledge\n- **Design Philosophy:** \"Híbrido Brutalista (Crudo + Elegante)\".\n- **UI/UX Directives:**\n    - \"No digas de que es la app\", \"letra mas thin en el resto\", \"no uses uppercase, usa capitalize\".\n    - Footer preference: \"3 lineas perfectamente equilibradas\", \"caja que no cubra mas de la mitad de la pantalla en X\", \"todo alineado a la derecha\".\n- **Aesthetic References:** \"revisa el footer de locomotive.ca\" (Benchmark for grid borders, stroke widths, and component density).\n- **Corrected Approach:** Relied on a constrained `w-full lg:w-[60%] ml-auto` container to house the footer rows, allowing them to stretch (`justify-between`) inside the container rather than spanning the full browser width.\n\n### 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Footer Layout Refactoring:**\n    - Consolidated footer into exactly 3 lines:\n        1. Location: Address | City, Country | Zip.\n        2. Telephone: Label + Code | Phone Grid.\n        3. Email: Label | Horseshoe Arrow | Domain.\n    - Wrapped all content in a 60% width container aligned to the right.\n    - Adjusted font sizes using `clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 3.5rem)` to prevent layout overflow within the new container constraints.\n- **Graphic Adjustments:**\n    - Standardized line weights to `2px` for grid borders and dividers.\n    - Updated email \"horseshoe\" arrow stroke to `4` to match the 2px grid lines.\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Layout Logic:** Combining `w-full lg:w-[60%] ml-auto` on the footer container successfully restricts the content's horizontal expansion while allowing the internal `flex justify-between` to maintain visual spacing.\n- **Failures:** Attempting to force the layout into fewer lines without reducing `font-size` caused text overlapping and container overflow; the current `clamp` values successfully mitigate this.\n\n### 5. Files and Code\n- **Edited Files:**\n    - `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/layout/Footer.tsx`: Refactored to group rows into a 60% container, reduced font sizes, and consolidated into 3 lines.\n- **Viewed Files:**\n    - `/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/layout/Footer.tsx`: Mapped row structure (lines 194-252) to perform consolidation.\n\n### 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Immediate Task:** The user confirmed the layout looks better but needs to ensure the content is readable and balanced after the font size reduction.\n- **Next Steps:**\n    1. Confirm with the user if the `clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 3.5rem)` size is readable enough or if further adjustments are needed.\n    2. Monitor potential layout drift in other components (`Header.tsx`, `CTA.tsx`) after global padding changes.\n- **User Quote:** \"no, se pasa y no se lee la infomacion\" (referring to the previous 60% box state).\n\nYou have the 5 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: aca_diario_1784858012774]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/aca_diario_1784858012774.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T01:53:32Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: edusur_1784857998587]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/edusur_1784857998587.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T01:53:18Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: plan-fase-5-cta]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/plan-fase-5-cta.md\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T02:50:00Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: polo_pantoja_1784857990917]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/polo_pantoja_1784857990917.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T01:53:10Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: salesforce_ai_1784858005915]\nPath: file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/salesforce_ai_1784858005915.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-07-24T01:53:25Z\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\":  \"74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/task-510\",\n  \"toolName\":  \"run_command\",\n  \"toolSummary\":  \"Run command\",\n  \"description\":  \"rm -rf .next/ && npm run dev\",\n  \"startTime\":  \"2026-07-23T20:48:42.792597175Z\",\n  \"stepIndex\":  510,\n  \"logUri\":  \"file:///home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7-8785-781c4ec34204/.system_generated/tasks/task-510.log\"\n}\n\n# Conversation Logs\n\nReference the following log files for the full, untruncated conversation:\n\n- /home/clouder/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/74f699fd-4686-4bd7