{"step_index":1687,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:47:02Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Tool Usage**\n\nI'm now focusing on tool selection, emphasizing specific tools over general ones where possible. The goal is to optimize efficiency by leveraging tools like 'view_file' directly, rather than resorting to broader, less direct methods. I'm aiming for targeted actions.\n\n\n**Refining Tool Choices**\n\nI'm adhering strictly to my tool usage rules, specifically avoiding generic terminal tools. I've chosen `replace_file_content` to modify `Preloader.tsx` to fix a loader animation layout. Now I'm considering completely rewriting `Preloader.tsx`.\n\n\n**Revising Component Logic**\n\nI'm now contemplating a complete overhaul of `Preloader.tsx` because its underlying structure will change substantially. The existing `step` state is redundant with the planned use of Framer Motion for timing and orchestration. I'm focusing on a more streamlined, animation-driven approach, eliminating the need for the step counter.\n\n\n**Implementing Animation Framework**\n\nI'm now integrating Framer Motion to animate the preloader transition, departing from the existing component's internal state management. My current focus is on a smooth visual fade-in and fade-out based on the provided animation code. I'll utilize the provided duration, easing, and visual design parameters for a streamlined preloader experience.\n\n\n**Integrating Visual Elements**\n\nI'm now incorporating animated text elements into the preloader with Framer Motion. I'm focusing on positioning and timing these elements, including fade-in/fade-out animations and text scrambling using the `ScrambleText` component. I aim for these elements to provide visual interest while the main animation completes. The current focus is adjusting the timing, opacity, and positioning of each element for a cohesive look.\n\n\n**Adjusting Visual Timing**\n\nI'm now refining the animation timing for the text elements in the preloader. I'm focusing on the `motion.div` instances, precisely the `delay` and `duration` values within the transition objects. I'm tweaking delays to provide a staggered reveal, and adjusting durations to ensure a consistent fade-in and out. The intent is to enhance the visual rhythm and ensure a polished presentation.\n\n\n**Clarifying Text Scramble**\n\nI'm now clarifying the requirement for the text scrambling animation. I'm reassessing the behavior of the `ScrambleText` component in relation to the fade-in animation provided by Framer Motion. I am considering timing constraints and ensuring the visual effects align with the prompt's specifications. The core issue is the scrambling effect potentially being executed on a hidden element, rendering the scramble useless.\n\n\n**Optimizing Visibility Logic**\n\nI'm now implementing conditional rendering with `useState` and `setTimeout` to synchronize the `ScrambleText` animation with its visibility. This ensures the scrambling effect is visible by rendering the text elements only when they're supposed to be shown, addressing a previous timing issue. I'm focusing on coordinated animations using `initial`, `animate`, and `exit` for smooth transitions.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Re-implement Preloader to have scattered blinking locations","EndLine":93,"Instruction":"Rewrite the entire Preloader component to use conditional rendering for the three staggered location texts.","ReplacementContent":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from \"framer-motion\";\nimport { ScrambleText } from \"@/components/ui/TextScrambler\";\n\nexport function Preloader() {\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [showPreloader, setShowPreloader] = useState(false);\n  \n  const [show1, setShow1] = useState(false);\n  const [show2, setShow2] = useState(false);\n  const [show3, setShow3] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const hasVisited = sessionStorage.getItem(\"buildroot_visited\");\n    \n    if (!hasVisited) {\n      setShowPreloader(true);\n      sessionStorage.setItem(\"buildroot_visited\", \"true\");\n      \n      const timers = [\n        setTimeout(() => setShow1(true), 500),\n        setTimeout(() => setShow1(false), 1700),\n        \n        setTimeout(() => setShow2(true), 1300),\n        setTimeout(() => setShow2(false), 2500),\n        \n        setTimeout(() => setShow3(true), 2100),\n        setTimeout(() => setShow3(false), 3300),\n        \n        setTimeout(() => setIsLoading(false), 4000),\n      ];\n      \n      return () => timers.forEach(clearTimeout);\n    } else {\n      setShowPreloader(false);\n      setIsLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!showPreloader) return null;\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isLoading && (\n        <motion.div\n          key=\"preloader\"\n          initial={{ y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ y: \"-100%\" }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.9, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-primary)] overflow-hidden\"\n        >\n          {/* Main Logo Center */}\n          <div className=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-10\">\n            <div className=\"overflow-hidden\">\n              <motion.div\n                initial={{ y: \"100%\" }}\n                animate={{ y: 0 }}\n                transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n                className=\"font-mono text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6rem] font-light tracking-tighter flex items-center\"\n              >\n                <ScrambleText text=\"buildroot\" speed={60} trigger=\"mount\" />\n                <motion.span\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: [0, 1, 0] }}\n                  transition={{ repeat: Infinity, duration: 0.8, ease: \"linear\" }}\n                  className=\"inline-block scale-y-75 origin-bottom ml-1\"\n                >\n                  _\n                </motion.span>\n              </motion.div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Floating Texts */}\n          <div className=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n            <AnimatePresence>\n              {/* Instance 1: Upper Left */}\n              {show1 && (\n                <motion.div\n                  key=\"loc1\"\n                  className=\"absolute top-[15%] left-[10%] md:top-[20%] md:left-[15%] flex flex-col font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70\"\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: 0.7 }}\n                  exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  transition={{ duration: 0.4 }}\n                >\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"BASED IN\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"IPIALES, COLOMBIA\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                </motion.div>\n              )}\n\n              {/* Instance 2: Lower Right */}\n              {show2 && (\n                <motion.div\n                  key=\"loc2\"\n                  className=\"absolute bottom-[25%] right-[10%] md:bottom-[30%] md:right-[15%] flex flex-col text-right font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70 items-end\"\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: 0.7 }}\n                  exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  transition={{ duration: 0.4 }}\n                >\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"BASED IN\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"IPIALES, COLOMBIA\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                </motion.div>\n              )}\n\n              {/* Instance 3: Further Down */}\n              {show3 && (\n                <motion.div\n                  key=\"loc3\"\n                  className=\"absolute bottom-[10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col text-center font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70 items-center\"\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: 0.7 }}\n                  exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  transition={{ duration: 0.4 }}\n                >\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"BASED IN\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"IPIALES, COLOMBIA\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                </motion.div>\n              )}\n            </AnimatePresence>\n          </div>\n        </motion.div>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  );\n}","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from \"framer-motion\";\nimport { ScrambleText } from \"@/components/ui/TextScrambler\";\n\nexport function Preloader() {\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [showPreloader, setShowPreloader] = useState(false);\n  const [step, setStep] = useState(1);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const hasVisited = sessionStorage.getItem(\"buildroot_visited\");\n    \n    if (!hasVisited) {\n      setShowPreloader(true);\n      sessionStorage.setItem(\"buildroot_visited\", \"true\");\n      \n      const t1 = setTimeout(() => setStep(2), 1600);\n      const t2 = setTimeout(() => setIsLoading(false), 3400);\n      \n      return () => {\n        clearTimeout(t1);\n        clearTimeout(t2);\n      };\n    } else {\n      setShowPreloader(false);\n      setIsLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!showPreloader) return null;\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isLoading && (\n        <motion.div\n          key=\"preloader\"\n          initial={{ y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ y: \"-100%\" }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.9, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-primary)] overflow-hidden\"\n        >\n          <AnimatePresence mode=\"wait\">\n            {step === 1 && (\n              <div key=\"step1\" className=\"overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <motion.div\n                  initial={{ y: \"100%\" }}\n                  animate={{ y: 0 }}\n                  exit={{ y: \"-100%\", opacity: 0 }}\n                  transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n                  className=\"font-mono text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6rem] font-light tracking-tighter flex items-center\"\n                >\n                  <ScrambleText text=\"buildroot\" speed={60} trigger=\"mount\" />\n                  <motion.span\n                    initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                    animate={{ opacity: [0, 1, 0] }}\n                    transition={{ repeat: Infinity, duration: 0.8, ease: \"linear\" }}\n                    className=\"inline-block scale-y-75 origin-bottom ml-1\"\n                  >\n                    _\n                  </motion.span>\n                </motion.div>\n              </div>\n            )}\n\n            {step === 2 && (\n              <motion.div \n                key=\"step2\" \n                className=\"flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs md:text-sm lg:text-base font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70\"\n                initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\n                transition={{ duration: 0 }}\n              >\n                <div className=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                  <motion.div\n                    initial={{ y: \"100%\" }}\n                    animate={{ y: 0 }}\n                    transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n                    className=\"whitespace-nowrap\"\n                  >\n                    <ScrambleText text=\"BASED IN IPIALES, COLOMBIA\" speed={40} trigger=\"mount\" />\n                  </motion.div>\n                </div>\n              </motion.div>\n            )}\n          </AnimatePresence>\n        </motion.div>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  );\n}","TargetFile":"/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/ui/Preloader.tsx","toolAction":"Rewrite Preloader logic for scattered text","toolSummary":"File edit"}}]}
