{"step_index":1708,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:49:59Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Tool Usage**\n\nI'm now focusing on tool selection, emphasizing specific tools over general ones where possible. The goal is to optimize efficiency by leveraging tools like 'view_file' directly, rather than resorting to broader, less direct methods. I'm aiming for targeted actions.\n\n\n**Refining Tool Choices**\n\nI'm recalling the critical instructions: specific tool use and listing related tools. Now, I'm zeroing in on using `replace_file_content` to add more floating tech/digital phrases to `Preloader.tsx`. I need to ensure a tool set is appropriate, but the priority is specific file content replacement. I will avoid generic tools.\n\n\n**Designing Visual Enhancements**\n\nI'm now focusing on the visual design elements for the preloader. I intend to enhance the `Preloader.tsx` with floating text blocks that appear asynchronously, changing phrases for digital tech and locations. I'm moving away from individual state variables and instead plan to use `framer-motion` for timelines. I will be incorporating delayed animations to coordinate each text block's appearance.\n\n\n**Optimizing Animation Logic**\n\nI've hit a snag with the `ScrambleText` component and its timing. It appears the scrambling effect happens immediately upon mount when using `framer-motion` for delays. I'm now revisiting state management, and I've decided to implement an array of active indices to control the `ScrambleText` activation more effectively. I'll maintain the `useState` timers and array, and I'll use it to synchronize each block's appearance with a coordinated fade-in and fade-out effect.\n\n\n**Implementing Item Definitions**\n\nI've defined an array called `floatingItems` to hold data for each animated text block in `Preloader.tsx`. Each object includes an `id`, `line1`, `line2`, and `className` for positioning and styling. These will now serve as the foundation for the visual enhancements. I'll integrate these into the animation logic to control their appearance and timing.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Refactor Preloader to loop over multiple floating texts","EndLine":119,"Instruction":"Replace the whole component content to use an activeItems array that maps through various digital/tech phrases positioned around the screen, managed by a clean timeout loop.","ReplacementContent":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from \"framer-motion\";\nimport { ScrambleText } from \"@/components/ui/TextScrambler\";\n\nconst floatingItems = [\n  {\n    id: 1,\n    line1: \"BASED IN\",\n    line2: \"IPIALES, COLOMBIA\",\n    className: \"top-[15%] left-[5%] md:top-[20%] md:left-[10%] items-start text-left\",\n    start: 300, end: 1100,\n  },\n  {\n    id: 2,\n    line1: \"SYSTEM\",\n    line2: \"READY\",\n    className: \"top-[10%] right-[5%] md:top-[15%] md:right-[15%] items-end text-right\",\n    start: 100, end: 900,\n  },\n  {\n    id: 3,\n    line1: \"BRUTALIST\",\n    line2: \"CODE\",\n    className: \"top-[50%] left-[5%] md:left-[10%] -translate-y-1/2 items-start text-left\",\n    start: 1000, end: 1800,\n  },\n  {\n    id: 4,\n    line1: \"DIGITAL\",\n    line2: \"EXPERIENCE\",\n    className: \"bottom-[25%] right-[5%] md:bottom-[30%] md:right-[10%] items-end text-right\",\n    start: 800, end: 1600,\n  },\n  {\n    id: 5,\n    line1: \"INIT\",\n    line2: \"SEQUENCE\",\n    className: \"top-[50%] right-[5%] md:right-[10%] -translate-y-1/2 items-end text-right\",\n    start: 1600, end: 2400,\n  },\n  {\n    id: 6,\n    line1: \"TECH\",\n    line2: \"VENTURE\",\n    className: \"bottom-[10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 items-center text-center\",\n    start: 1400, end: 2200,\n  },\n];\n\nexport function Preloader() {\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [showPreloader, setShowPreloader] = useState(false);\n  const [activeItems, setActiveItems] = useState<number[]>([]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const hasVisited = sessionStorage.getItem(\"buildroot_visited\");\n    \n    if (!hasVisited) {\n      setShowPreloader(true);\n      sessionStorage.setItem(\"buildroot_visited\", \"true\");\n      \n      const timers = floatingItems.flatMap((item) => [\n        setTimeout(() => setActiveItems((prev) => [...prev, item.id]), item.start),\n        setTimeout(() => setActiveItems((prev) => prev.filter((id) => id !== item.id)), item.end),\n      ]);\n      \n      timers.push(setTimeout(() => setIsLoading(false), 2600));\n      \n      return () => timers.forEach(clearTimeout);\n    } else {\n      setShowPreloader(false);\n      setIsLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!showPreloader) return null;\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isLoading && (\n        <motion.div\n          key=\"preloader\"\n          initial={{ y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ y: \"-100%\" }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.9, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-primary)] overflow-hidden\"\n        >\n          {/* Main Logo Center */}\n          <div className=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-10\">\n            <div className=\"overflow-hidden\">\n              <motion.div\n                initial={{ y: \"100%\" }}\n                animate={{ y: 0 }}\n                transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n                className=\"font-mono text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6rem] font-light tracking-tighter flex items-center\"\n              >\n                <ScrambleText text=\"buildroot\" speed={60} trigger=\"mount\" />\n                <motion.span\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: [0, 1, 0] }}\n                  transition={{ repeat: Infinity, duration: 0.8, ease: \"linear\" }}\n                  className=\"inline-block scale-y-75 origin-bottom ml-1\"\n                >\n                  _\n                </motion.span>\n              </motion.div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Floating Texts */}\n          <div className=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n            <AnimatePresence>\n              {floatingItems.map((item) => (\n                activeItems.includes(item.id) && (\n                  <motion.div\n                    key={`loc-${item.id}`}\n                    className={`absolute flex flex-col font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70 ${item.className}`}\n                    initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                    animate={{ opacity: 0.7 }}\n                    exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                    transition={{ duration: 0.2 }}\n                  >\n                    <span><ScrambleText text={item.line1} speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                    <span><ScrambleText text={item.line2} speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                  </motion.div>\n                )\n              ))}\n            </AnimatePresence>\n          </div>\n        </motion.div>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  );\n}","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from \"framer-motion\";\nimport { ScrambleText } from \"@/components/ui/TextScrambler\";\n\nexport function Preloader() {\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [showPreloader, setShowPreloader] = useState(false);\n  \n  const [show1, setShow1] = useState(false);\n  const [show2, setShow2] = useState(false);\n  const [show3, setShow3] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const hasVisited = sessionStorage.getItem(\"buildroot_visited\");\n    \n    if (!hasVisited) {\n      setShowPreloader(true);\n      sessionStorage.setItem(\"buildroot_visited\", \"true\");\n      \n      const timers = [\n        setTimeout(() => setShow1(true), 300),\n        setTimeout(() => setShow1(false), 1100),\n        \n        setTimeout(() => setShow2(true), 800),\n        setTimeout(() => setShow2(false), 1600),\n        \n        setTimeout(() => setShow3(true), 1300),\n        setTimeout(() => setShow3(false), 2100),\n        \n        setTimeout(() => setIsLoading(false), 2600),\n      ];\n      \n      return () => timers.forEach(clearTimeout);\n    } else {\n      setShowPreloader(false);\n      setIsLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!showPreloader) return null;\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isLoading && (\n        <motion.div\n          key=\"preloader\"\n          initial={{ y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ y: \"-100%\" }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.9, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n          className=\"fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-primary)] overflow-hidden\"\n        >\n          {/* Main Logo Center */}\n          <div className=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-10\">\n            <div className=\"overflow-hidden\">\n              <motion.div\n                initial={{ y: \"100%\" }}\n                animate={{ y: 0 }}\n                transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.76, 0, 0.24, 1] }}\n                className=\"font-mono text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6rem] font-light tracking-tighter flex items-center\"\n              >\n                <ScrambleText text=\"buildroot\" speed={60} trigger=\"mount\" />\n                <motion.span\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: [0, 1, 0] }}\n                  transition={{ repeat: Infinity, duration: 0.8, ease: \"linear\" }}\n                  className=\"inline-block scale-y-75 origin-bottom ml-1\"\n                >\n                  _\n                </motion.span>\n              </motion.div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Floating Texts */}\n          <div className=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n            <AnimatePresence>\n              {/* Instance 1: Upper Left */}\n              {show1 && (\n                <motion.div\n                  key=\"loc1\"\n                  className=\"absolute top-[15%] left-[10%] md:top-[20%] md:left-[15%] flex flex-col font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70\"\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: 0.7 }}\n                  exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  transition={{ duration: 0.2 }}\n                >\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"BASED IN\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"IPIALES, COLOMBIA\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                </motion.div>\n              )}\n\n              {/* Instance 2: Lower Right */}\n              {show2 && (\n                <motion.div\n                  key=\"loc2\"\n                  className=\"absolute bottom-[25%] right-[10%] md:bottom-[30%] md:right-[15%] flex flex-col text-right font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70 items-end\"\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: 0.7 }}\n                  exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  transition={{ duration: 0.2 }}\n                >\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"BASED IN\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"IPIALES, COLOMBIA\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                </motion.div>\n              )}\n\n              {/* Instance 3: Further Down */}\n              {show3 && (\n                <motion.div\n                  key=\"loc3\"\n                  className=\"absolute bottom-[10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col text-center font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs font-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-70 items-center\"\n                  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  animate={{ opacity: 0.7 }}\n                  exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n                  transition={{ duration: 0.2 }}\n                >\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"BASED IN\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                  <span><ScrambleText text=\"IPIALES, COLOMBIA\" speed={30} trigger=\"mount\" /></span>\n                </motion.div>\n              )}\n            </AnimatePresence>\n          </div>\n        </motion.div>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  );\n}","TargetFile":"/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/ui/Preloader.tsx","toolAction":"Update Preloader with dynamic flashing texts","toolSummary":"File edit"}}]}
