 Home page: detect when scrolled past hero\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (pathname !== \"/\") return;","TargetFile":"/home/clouder/Documents/projects/buildroot/front-buildroot/components/layout/Header.tsx","toolAction":"Update Header with dictionary support","toolSummary":"File edit"}}]}
